WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — game-engines (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.312
<v Narrator>Na farko, da daidai integer-numa physics, daya wasan blueprint replays identical a kan Windows, macOS, Linux, da manyan injiniyoyi.

2
00:00:10.392 --> 00:00:21.212
<v Narrator>Na biyu, standard decimal mathematics drifts a kan tsarin aiki cikin frame na dari bakwai da goma sha biyar, raba chaotic collisions daban.

3
00:00:21.292 --> 00:00:32.190
<v Narrator>Na uku, katin zane-zane na bambanta kadan a kan pixels, don haka nunawa yana zaune cikin aminci bayan wani hanya daya gadon juriya mai gani.
